flowchart TD
    A[Start Payroll Calculation] --> B[Load Attendance Data]
    B --> C[Load Approved Leave Requests]
    C --> D[Load Approved Overtime Records]
    D --> E[Load Employee Profile<br/>(Base Salary, Allowance)]

    E --> F[Set Standard Working Days = 26]

    F --> G{Leave Days > Available Leave?}
    G -- No --> H[Paid Working Days = 26]
    G -- Yes --> I[Paid Working Days = 26 - Excess Leave Days]

    H --> J[Daily Salary = Base Salary / 26]
    I --> J

    J --> K[Time-based Salary = Daily Salary × Paid Working Days]

    K --> L[Count Late Arrivals]
    L --> M[Late Penalty = Late Count × 50,000]

    M --> N[Hourly Salary = Base Salary / 176]

    N --> O[OT Weekday Pay = OT Hours × Hourly Salary × 1.5]
    O --> P[OT Holiday Pay = OT Hours × Hourly Salary × 2.0]

    P --> Q[Total Overtime Pay = OT1 + OT2]

    Q --> R[Gross Income =<br/>Time-based Salary + OT Pay + Allowance - Penalty]

    R --> S[Insurance Deduction = Base Salary × 10.5%]

    S --> T[Taxable Income = Gross Income - Insurance - Personal Deduction - Dependent Deduction]

    T --> U[Calculate PIT<br/>(Progressive Tax)]

    U --> V[Net Salary = Gross Income - Insurance - PIT]

    V --> W[Save Payroll Result]
    W --> X[End Payroll Calculation]
